{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The options are similar. However, the case for $-7\\le x \\le5$ is different.\n\nWe can see that by noting that the first case in graph $A$ begins at $(-7,8)$ and the first case in graph $B$ begins at $(-7,9)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The rule for the first case is $y=2-x$. When $x=-7$, the $y$-value should be $9$.\n\n**The correct graph is $B$.**\n\n[[☃ image 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"image 1":{"alignment":"block","graded":true,"options":{"alt":"correct answer","backgroundImage":{"height":225,"url":"web+graphie:${☣ LOCALPATH}/images/2900407dba1251b6cdaf147fa7c85399313a312e","width":225},"box":[225,225],"caption":"","labels":[],"range":[[0,10],[0,10]],"static":false,"title":""},"static":false,"type":"image","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$h(x) = \\begin{cases}\n2-x \u0026 , \u0026  -7\\le x \\le5\n\\\\\\\\\n3x-21 \u0026 , \u0026 5 \u003c x \\le 9\n\\end{cases}$\n\n**What is the graph of $h$?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"![answer A](web+graphie:${☣ LOCALPATH}/images/78bbc8c8a6f46c686eef794d38f148bfaef063b7)","correct":false},{"content":"![answer B](web+graphie:${☣ LOCALPATH}/images/2900407dba1251b6cdaf147fa7c85399313a312e)","correct":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
